    "directions": [
      "In a large heavy based sauté or saucepan, fry the sausages and lardons in the olive oil for 5 minutes, then remove from the pan and place to one side.",
      "In the same pan, gently cook the onions for 5 minutes then add the celeriac and cook for a further 3 minutes, stirring frequently.",
      "Add the garlic, thyme and tomato purée, stir well and cook for 2 more minutes.",
      "Pour in the red wine, bouillon, Worcestershire sauce, mustard and bay leaves, then stir well.",
      "Bring the contents of the pan to a simmer, return the sausages and bacon to the pan and cook for about 10 minutes uncovered.",
      "Add the kale and beans and cook for a further 5 minutes.",
      "Thicken with the Bisto Gravy Granules and serve in a bowl with crusty bread."
    ],
